	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a domino, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> integerrime omnibusque <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>modis reverende et excolende.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Intellexi ex scriptis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tuis ad D. <persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName> redditis calamitosam evangelicę veritatis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cladem et efferatam rabiem atque truculentiam, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quam <persName ref="p18538">Carolus</persName>, lupus immanissimus, contra Christi oves <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>instituit, qui cum blandis verborum lenociniis hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nimium credulos dementarit, tandem, quę occultata <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>falsa simulatione delituerant, rebus suis omnibus (ut ipse <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>censet), stabilitis sese diutius retinere nequeunt, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quin sese iam cum magno multorum periculo prodant.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Itaque decebit nos Satanę insultus vilipendere et <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>seria oratione pro adiutorio dominum interpellere eaque <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>prorsus, quę sunt poenitentię exquirere et ad ea conniti atque deinde, quicquid <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>accidat, solida spe concepta in dei gratiam magno animo <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>expectare, quid deus operari velit, qui mirabiliter agit, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>qui dignetur nos reddere imperterritos et constantes, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut, si coelum ruat, non extimescamus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Providit dominus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>terminum huic bestię, quem non transibit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quodsi deus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>requireret nos in periculum, tum oporteret notram <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>operam impendere, quo hoc scelus compesceretur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>non exoptate et erecto atque magnanimo pectore id <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>prestaret?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Effoeminatorum est mortem exhorrescere <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>pro scelerato <persName ref="p18538">Cęsaris</persName> conatu; nescit ut suo successu, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>dei pupillam Satanico fastu non reveretur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed ecce <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>invocamus dominum fiducia certa; aderit nobis, non sinet <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tam innania scelera, quae imbelli plebeculę intorsit, i<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nulta.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quodsi dominus nos in partem huius negocii <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>vocare velit, sumus in procinctu parati potius mori <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>quam in nos grassari hanc bestiam <placeName ref="l2131">Babylonicam</placeName> pati.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">D. <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> in sua afflictione consolare; habebit apud <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nos locum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Accesit me D. <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> et ostendi literas, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quibus lectis consilium dedi, quod illi placebat, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>et omnes literati laborabimus, quo <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> noster <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>fiat, quem semper ob eruditionem et candorem, quem <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ex scriptis sentire mihi videbar, maxime feci, licet <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>in re sacramentaria nimium <persName ref="p20051">Vertumnis</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p20051">Vertumnus</persName>: Gott des steten Wandels; vgl. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 2, 2, 74 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 473).</note> accedere <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>(fortassis immerito; nam non meum est id iudicare) visus <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>sit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed quicquid sit, si bene sentit, nam nosti nos <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>adhucdum esse tenellos, impendemus operam sedulam, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quam et brevi senties, ut confido, nun fuisse inanem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Interea salutabis meo nomine D. <persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> et omnes <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>fratres, quos omnes integros exopto, et omnes nos ad Christi <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>crucem accingamus, quam ubi in fauces Satanę <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>impegimus, evanescit prorsus ad nihilum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>in domino.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Raptim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Datum 9. iulii anno 48.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>Tuus totus <persName ref="p3700">Eber[hardus] a Rümlang</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Vigilantissimo et integerrimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>primario, domino et patrono <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo semper colendissimo<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>.</s>
				</p>
